@startuml
title ParametricCAD — model change and recompute flow

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant FeatureEditorPanel as Panel
participant ModelingController as Controller
participant QUndoStack as Stack
participant ChangeParametricPropertyCommand as Command
participant Body
participant ParametricFeature as Feature
participant ModelPresenter as Presenter
participant CadViewer as Viewer

User -> Panel : finish property edit
Panel -> Controller : setFeatureProperty(id, key, value)
Controller -> Controller : validate descriptor and value
Controller -> Stack : push(Command(before, after))
Stack -> Command : redo()
Command -> Feature : setProperty(after)
Command -> Body : markDirtyFrom(featureId)
Command -> Body : recompute()
Body -> Feature : recompute dirty dependencies
Feature --> Body : new TopoDS_Shape / error state
Body --> Command : completed
Stack --> Controller : indexChanged
Controller -> Presenter : refresh()
Presenter -> Body : recompute and inspect visibility
Presenter -> Viewer : updateFeature(shape, id)
Presenter -> Viewer : setHiddenFeatures(ids)
Controller -> Panel : refreshed descriptors and action state

note over Stack,Command
  QUndoStack::push() calls redo() once.
  No model mutation occurs before push().
end note
@enduml
